      <div type="clause" n="13">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 13</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LVII} Gif hwa biforan biscepe his gewitnesse ⁊ his wed aleoge, gebete mid CXX sciƚƚ.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone gives false witness or denies his pledge before the bishop, let him compensate with 120 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone bears false witness in the presence of a bishop, or repudiates a pledge which he has given in his presence, he shall pay 120 shillings compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa biforan biscope his gewitnesse ⁊ his wed aleoge, gebete mid CXX shillingum.</ab>
      </div>
